# The build context is only what the Dockerfile copies. Everything else stays out, above all .env (secrets),
# voices/ (personal data) and the 9 GB .venv. When the Dockerfile copies something new, add it here.
*
!requirements.txt
!app
!static
!config
!scripts
scripts/*
!scripts/stack
!run.sh
!stop.sh
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
